                        target="#pg56">p. 56</ref>. The final sentence indicated “thinking Indian
                    Govt differs from Makins’ statement of Nehru’s position”.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d48-f2" n="2" xml:id="d48-f2-content">
